# SKILL-BLOCK:zamm:BEGIN version=sha:bbbe8ea167fa date=2026-09-01
# ZAMM deliberately lists NOTHING here.
#
# The Cursor Agent Sandbox maps every .cursorignore-matched path to EPERM,
# and the ZAMM toolchain enumerates its trees with checked find(1) calls that
# fail closed on an unreadable path (references/invariants.md, G3: absent is
# data, unreadable is an error). Any zamm-memory rule in this file therefore
# breaks a ZAMM command inside the sandbox: archive/** broke `memory digest`,
# and the plan workdir rules broke `status` and `plan archive`, whose
# self-containment scan must walk workdir/ to enforce G5.
#
# Retired trees and plan scratch are hidden from codebase search via
# .cursorindexingignore instead: excluded from the index, still readable.
# Do not move those rules back here.
# SKILL-BLOCK:zamm:END
